WEBVTT

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:34.270
At last, we reached
the true Claire Bible!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.340
And there I learned
what the ultimate goal is...

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.530
...of the golden Dark
Lord of all Dark Lords!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.740
It was then that Gaav, the Demon
Dragon King, attacked us again!

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.810
While I was able to kill Saygram
using the perfected Ragna Blade...

00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.610
...Xellos has fallen
before Gaav's attack!

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:53.780
Not bad, Gaav! It's time we
settled things once and for all!

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:12.030
An attack from the Astral Plane.

00:02:12.110 --> 00:02:14.940
I decided to use your own
specialty against you, Xellos.

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:19.350
Well, well...
I'm flattered, my dear Gaav.

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:23.210
Hmpf... Still, you're
impressive as ever, Xellos.

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:28.220
Even after taking my attack just
now, you're still very much alive.

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:34.360
Although it'll take me a while to
recover from what you just did.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:36.990
Exactly right.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:40.630
In that case...

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.260
Why don't you just accept
your defeat and tell me?

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:47.110
What are Hellmaster's plans?
What is he up to?!

00:02:49.250 --> 00:02:50.910
Th- They're...

00:02:51.310 --> 00:02:52.910
They're what?

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:53.950
Xellos!

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.810
Tell me!

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.250
They're... a secret.

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.990
What?!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.160
He ran away?

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.720
At a time like this?! Just how
irresponsible can that guy be?!

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:20.370
In the end, this is
how all Monsters act.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:24.810
They don't care if they abandon their
comrades if it'll save their own lives.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.610
Now, then...

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:32.250
I may not know exactly
what Hellmaster is up to...

00:03:32.320 --> 00:03:35.350
...but I have to ruin
his plans no matter what!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.690
Lina!

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:46.900
No good... It's because I used
the Ragna Blade to kill Saygram!

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.130
I still haven't recovered my strength!

00:03:51.670 --> 00:03:57.310
I will say I'm impressed you managed
to confound my plans so well till now.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.640
Sorry, but now you must die!

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.080
I won't let you!

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:05.050
I'm this girl's protector!

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.960
I can't just stand
by and let you do this!

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:10.990
Neither can I!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.150
She's my friend.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:17.060
No matter what, I can't just go
along with what you're planning!

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:20.870
That's because,
unlike Xellos, I'm human!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.300
Gourry... Zel...

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:31.310
Ridiculous! You risk your lives
when you know you can't win!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.710
Shut your mouth.
We're fighting for our lives here.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.650
Did you really think
we'd give up so easily?

00:04:38.950 --> 00:04:41.320
Heh... For your lives, huh?

00:04:41.390 --> 00:04:46.950
I see... Just as I'm fighting for
MY life against Hellmaster's plans.

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:50.490
We're not so different, you and I.

00:05:01.710 --> 00:05:06.670
Lina... No matter what we say,
there's no way we can beat this guy.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:07.880
Zel...

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:12.440
Our only hope is that spell
you used to defeat Saygram.

00:05:12.550 --> 00:05:16.250
Zel and I will try to buy you enough
time to recover your strength.

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:18.290
Gourry...

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.890
Ah... That's an interesting
weapon you have there.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.170
Well, I suppose
we are very much alike.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:33.610
Meaning that expecting you to
quietly die is out of the question.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:39.110
Well, then, resist me as you can!
For the sake of your own lives!

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.890
RAH TILT!

00:05:52.960 --> 00:05:56.630
That spell harmed me no
more that a kitten's scratch.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:00.390
It did hurt, but I was able
to defend against it!

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:07.670
Even a human wielding the sword
Gorn Nova is no match for me!

00:06:10.980 --> 00:06:11.910
Gourry!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.720
No use... I can't move...

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:20.120
And at a time like this!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.390
DUG HAUT!

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:28.690
ASTRAL VINE!!!

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:11.440
You both try very
hard for mere humans.

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:13.130
This was actually a lot of fun.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:23.380
However, all good things
must come to an end. Right?

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.120
DAMN YOU!!!

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:39.470
Gourry!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:40.730
Zel!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:44.130
DYNAST BRAS!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:50.710
Who?!

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.540
No matter how great
your power may be...

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:57.050
...as long as it never gives up
and fights with all its strength...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.750
...Justice will always triumph!

00:08:02.290 --> 00:08:04.990
- Amelia!
- When did she recover?

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.020
And here I was
worrying about her...

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:11.330
Amelia... How can you be
so blase about him?

00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:16.900
Sorry for the wait.
I'll heal you now.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.900
Just be patient a bit longer.

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.850
Sorry I took so long, but that girl
was much more seriously hurt.

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.180
Milgasia...

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:34.160
Now that I, who bears the mission
of Justice, has recovered...

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.890
...I won't let you
get away with this!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.980
What happened to me was due
to my being caught unaware!

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:40.820
Caught by you, who spreads
chaos in this world!

00:08:40.900 --> 00:08:44.590
The time has come for retribution!
Prepare yourself!

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:49.560
Heh, don't make me laugh!
Now listen to me!

00:08:49.640 --> 00:08:52.870
So long as Lina is knowingly
helping Hellmaster's plans...

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.970
...which are the source
of chaos in this world...

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.600
...then your good
friend is a villain!

00:08:58.050 --> 00:09:00.480
Huh?! B- But, that's... That's!

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:03.450
And, as her allies,
YOU must be villains as well!

00:09:03.650 --> 00:09:08.210
I'm a villain?!
No! But, that is, uh...

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.150
Hey, I think
Amelia's in real trouble.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:13.090
Uh-oh...

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:16.290
I hate people who hypocritically
brandish "Justice" around.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.160
Now begone!

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.090
Rah Ti...

00:09:20.170 --> 00:09:21.260
Too late!

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.540
Mr. Zelgadis...

00:09:32.610 --> 00:09:34.580
Mr. Zelgadis, hang on!

00:09:45.190 --> 00:09:46.860
Do you understand now?

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:49.230
No matter how "just"
you may consider yourself...

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:52.130
...in the face of
overwhelming power...

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.000
...you are helpless.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:13.080
"Lord of the dreams that terrify..."

00:10:13.160 --> 00:10:17.750
"Sword of cold and darkness, free
yourself from the heavens' bonds!"

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:19.660
"Become one with my power,
one with my body..."

00:10:19.730 --> 00:10:21.990
"...and let us walk the
path of destruction together!"

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:25.190
"Power that can smash
even the souls of the gods!"

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.600
RAGNA BLADE!!!

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:55.630
It's taking every shred of will-power
I have to control the blade...

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:02.470
Hm... The power of the
Lord of Nightmares, eh?

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:08.480
But this is the only spell
we have left to use! I...

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:14.840
I'm going to bet everything...

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:17.280
...on this one attack!

00:11:22.930 --> 00:11:25.450
Just try! JUST TRY!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:27.130
Sword...

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.270
...of Darkness!!!

00:12:55.390 --> 00:12:58.350
I won... I won!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.460
Milgasia...

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:18.140
Thank you...

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.310
Gourry... Guys...

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.150
Miss Lina!

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:32.580
Amelia...

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.680
Thank goodness... You're okay...

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:44.530
Little boy...
What happened? Well?

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.170
Huh? Little boy?

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.510
Just rest a little more, Lina.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.550
Gourry...

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:00.950
Never mind. Don't say anything.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:07.750
You really are one in a million.

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:14.220
Is the Demon
Dragon King Gaav?

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:18.560
Hey, nobody could stand
up to an attack like that!

00:14:18.640 --> 00:14:19.970
I guess you're right.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.870
Everyone! Something
terrible's happened! That boy!

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:26.700
He's disappeared!

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.540
That boy? Wasn't he with you?

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.200
He was at my side
until a little while ago...

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:54.500
Enjoyable... Very, VERY enjoyable...

00:14:54.940 --> 00:14:58.430
Oh, no... Even a perfected
Ragna Blade couldn't work.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.870
Gourry!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:06.540
I'm gonna try to
give us all a chance.

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:11.850
EVERYBODY, RUN!!!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.010
Move it, Martina!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:17.860
What? Are you finished?

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.090
Then allow me to kill you all!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.250
Y- You!

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.030
When did you?!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:02.400
I've been here all along...
Demon Dragon King Gaav!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:04.030
Little boy!

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:08.810
It seems that nobody aside from
Xellos realized who I really was.

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.010
Not Lina Inverse... And not you.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:16.850
Who are you?

00:16:17.790 --> 00:16:20.880
Oh, yes! I never told
you my name, did I?

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:25.290
My name is Phibrizzo, but
you can call me Hellmaster.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:30.730
Oh, no! YOU'RE a Monster?!
Ooh... Another Monster...

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.330
So, at last the puppet master
appears... is what I'd like to say.

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:39.200
I didn't realize...
We met a while ago, didn't we?

00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:45.110
In other words, I was
totally suckered by you.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.640
By both you and Xellos.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:50.690
Taking a child's form
is so convenient!

00:16:50.750 --> 00:16:52.480
You humans are amusing.

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.620
With this form, you never
suspected me at all.

00:17:01.230 --> 00:17:04.890
And you all behaved
just as I expected you would.

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:08.830
Even Gaav showed up just
when I predicted he would.

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:13.600
Thanks to having part of your
astral body cut away in that form...

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:16.200
...you didn't realize who I was.

00:17:16.550 --> 00:17:21.450
Hmm... I was thinking I could
tear the human part out of you...

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:25.110
...but it seems you can never
be a pure Monster again.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:31.050
And saying that, I doubt very much
you'd swear your loyalty to me.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:36.130
Which means the only course left
to me... is to just kill you outright!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.630
You son of a!!!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.210
It... It can't be!

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.660
An... An enemy Miss Lina
couldn't kill with...

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:03.090
...the Ragna Blade,
he could in a second!

00:18:04.260 --> 00:18:07.460
I suppose this is all going
according to your plan, too, right?

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:10.060
Well, mainly.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:13.570
I let it slip out to his servants
that I was planning something...

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:17.440
...which involved using Lina Inverse.
That's how this all began.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.370
So, you sent Xellos to point
us in the right direction...

00:18:21.440 --> 00:18:24.040
...and let us mess up all
of Gaav's plans for you.

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:28.350
Whereupon you come in at the
end and finish Gaav off yourself.

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:31.410
Hmpf! Easy job for you!

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:33.550
Oh, I suppose.

00:18:33.620 --> 00:18:36.220
Huh? Uh, what exactly?

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:40.990
In other words, we were used as bait to
trap Gaav, a traitor to the Monsters.

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.600
Yes, that was one of the reasons.

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:44.630
One of them?

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:46.570
You mean you had other
reasons for doing this?!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.800
Oh, I thought
you'd figured that out.

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.900
Especially Lina Inverse, who has
touched the true Claire Bible.

00:18:54.580 --> 00:18:57.670
To destroy the world.
Destroy everything.

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:59.770
To return everything to chaos.

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:02.320
That is the ultimate
goal of the Monster race.

00:19:03.150 --> 00:19:06.640
And for that,
we need you, Lina Inverse.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:12.690
I had hoped that you'd play
your final card when fighting Gaav.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.790
That was a disappointment.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:22.130
Anyway, you're in no condition
now to grant my request, so...

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.710
Now, then...

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:29.270
Monsters! Monsters! Monsters!

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:31.640
I am sick of being
tricked by you things!

00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:35.480
I am protected by the
monstrous Zoamelgustar!

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:36.920
Martina!

00:19:36.990 --> 00:19:40.580
Monster! Now, all the pain I've
suffered shall be cleared away!

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:45.550
Miss Martina!

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:51.100
Out of respect for "Zoamelgustar,"
I'll spare your life...

00:19:51.530 --> 00:19:53.000
...my dear "big sister."

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.260
You're inhuman!
Even for a non-human...

00:19:57.340 --> 00:19:59.740
That's playing too rough, kid.

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:05.710
Oh, yes! You! You'll do nicely!

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:14.850
Gourry!

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:22.990
Gourry! Gourry! GOURRY!!!

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.690
LINA-A-A-A!!!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:29.740
GOURRY!!!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.240
Lina!

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:38.040
Miss Lina!

00:20:38.110 --> 00:20:42.280
If you want him back,
then come to my city.

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:45.450
Yes... Come to Sairaag!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.450
Sairaag?!

00:20:49.660 --> 00:20:52.790
Hellmaster Phibrizzo...
The lord of the underworld...

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:55.260
...who wants to destroy everything
and return it to chaos.

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.890
There's no way we'll ever
beat him using normal methods.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.370
But now that I know the
truth, I can't use it...

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.630
I can never use THAT spell!
